WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.930
One page of prose on an exam desk.

2
00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:04.290
No title page.

3
00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:05.400
No blurb.

4
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:06.790
Just this.

5
00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:10.820
You don't know the author, the
story, or what happens next.

6
00:00:10.870 --> 00:00:12.670
Your highlighter hovers.

7
00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:14.420
Where should it land?

8
00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:17.730
So with a passage from a
story you've never read,

9
00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:20.510
how do you find the writer's choices?

10
00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:25.440
In this mission, you'll learn what an
unseen prose question really tests:

11
00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:28.780
what was chosen, and
what each choice does.

12
00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:33.350
You'll try a routine of three reads,
each asking a different question.

13
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.660
And you'll test it on a short
scene, set at night in a garden.

14
00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:42.550
Your mission: work out how to find the
choices in a passage you've never read.
